### Notes for review

- **Single render guard** — `v-if="!hideFilesHeader"` wraps the whole strip (title, actions, file list), so nothing is mounted while collapsed; no layout placeholder remains.
- **Prop is passive** — `Chat.vue` never mutates it; `ChatView` derives it as `isMobile && !showMobileDetails`, so desktop always shows the strip.
- **No prop validation added** — matches the existing untyped array `props` style of this file.
- **State preserved** — file/profile actions stay identical when the strip is visible, and toggling the mobile header re-mounts it with `:defaultOpen="false"` (collapsed), so no unexpected expansion.

