### Notes for review

- **Only two edits** — the new `hideFilesHeader` prop entry and `v-if="!hideFilesHeader"` on the `<Collapsible>` strip. All newer logic (`attachmentTasks`, `flushPendingAttachments`, resilient `updateMessage`) is preserved untouched.
- **No behaviour loss** — `ChatView.vue` already passes `:hide-files-header="isMobile && !showMobileDetails"`, so desktop and expanded mobile keep the strip exactly as before.
- **Nothing mounted while hidden** — the whole strip (title, `ChatProfileSelector`, `CheckLists`, `ChatFileList`) is skipped, so no empty placeholder row remains; re-expanding mounts it collapsed (`:defaultOpen="false"`).
